{
  "id": "201",
  "title": "Freebie at the Restaurant",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2016-11-09",
  "synopsis": "If you spend a lot of money at a restaurant it's always worth asking for a freebie, right?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/271/96db645a08618f654dec3b9de793e9247df15b97.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "送什么？\n\n    今天早上，我送表妹上学，顺便一起吃了早点。我们俩人一顿吃了30元。\n    我去结账时对老板说：“老板，你看看我吃了那么多钱，你送我点什么吧！”\n    老板想了想，说：“那我送你出去吧！”",
    "traditional": "送什麼？\n\n    今天早上，我送表妹上學，順便一起吃了早點。我們倆人一頓吃了30元。\n    我去結賬時對老闆說：“老闆，你看看我吃了那麼多錢，你送我點什麼吧！”\n    老闆想了想，說：“那我送你出去吧！”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Give What?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "今天早上，我送表妹上学，顺便一起吃了早点。",
      "traditional": "今天早上，我送表妹上學，順便一起吃了早點。",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān zǎo shang wǒ sòng biǎo mèi shàng xué shùn biàn yì qǐ chī le zǎo diǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "我们俩人一顿吃了30元。",
      "traditional": "我們倆人一頓吃了30元。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ men liǎ rén yí dùn chī le 2 yuán",
      "english": "This morning I sent my little cousin to school, and we stopped on the way to have breakfast together."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Altogether the two of us ate for 30 yuan."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "我去结账时对老板说：“老板，你看看我吃了那么多钱，你送我点什么吧！”",
      "traditional": "我去結賬時對老闆說：“老闆，你看看我吃了那麼多錢，你送我點什麼吧！”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ qù jié zhàng shí duì lǎo bǎn shuō lǎo bǎn nǐ kàn kan wǒ chī le nà me duō qián nǐ sòng wǒ diǎn shén me ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "When I went to pay I told the owner: “Owner, look how much money I ate for, can't you give me something?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "老板想了想，说：“那我送你出去吧！”",
      "traditional": "老闆想了想，說：“那我送你出去吧！”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo bǎn xiǎng le xiǎng shuō nà wǒ sòng nǐ chū qù ba",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
